 "id": "c0336347-e2c5-4e4e-a22e-ce1ad7ce2adc",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Mao No Aisai Wa Aisarenai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "魔王の愛妻は愛されない"
   },
   {
    "en": "The demon king's wife"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where the war between humans and demons (magical beings) never seems to end, one day, the Demon King Gil arrives at Hazelbart Kingdom, the strongest of all human kingdoms.\n\nGil presents a shocking proposal — a truce and peace treaty between the world of humans and the world of demons, on the condition that both sides respect each other’s territories and never cross the border.\n\nSeeing this agreement as a chance to elevate her own son’s status, the kingdom’s second queen secretly hatches a devious scheme.\n\nAs a result of her plot, Princess Estelle is chosen as the sacrifice — forced to marry the Demon King as a condition to seal the peace treaty…\n\nSuddenly, Estelle finds herself the bride of the Demon King — a man completely foreign to her world, with a cold expression and mysterious intentions.",
   "ja": "人間と魔族が絶えない争いを繰り返している世界…人間領土の大国・ハゼルバート王国に、ある日魔族の王「ギル」がやってきた。ギルは互いの領土への不可侵を条件に人間に対し「休戦」を申し出る。しかし協定を我が子クレモンの功績にしたい継母である王妃の策略で、王女エステルは交換条件として魔族の王へ嫁ぐことになり……。"
  },
